   "step": "Move the cooked chicken and veggies to clean bowls or a clean pan to cool. Spread them out, do not stack, so heat escapes fast and the food leaves the danger zone quickly. Check the rice: it is done when the liquid is absorbed and the grains are tender. Drain it in the colander and spread it on a clean sheet pan to cool fast (rice must be refrigerated within 1 hour)."
